<title>UK: Bank Dibens prices $50 million step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Dibens prices $50 million step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Agricole Indosuez.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO DIBENS S.A.</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON    *10.O	MATURITY    02.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.66     PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  60 BP     REOFFER    99.99     PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  MGT/UND    30 BP     SELL CONC   30 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	* STEPS-UP TO 10.375 PCT FROM 02.JUL.00.</p>
<p>		 PUT AND CALL OPTIONS AT 99.71 IN THREE-YEARS TO</p>
<p>GIVE</p>
<p>		 A SPREAD OF +380 BP OVER THE THREE-YEAR UST AND THE</p>
<p>		 INTERPOLATED EIGHT-YEAR U.S.T.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
